### Test HealthCheckForm API

### 1. Create HealthCheckForm - Success case
POST https://localhost:7111/api/HealthCheckForm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "parentId": 1,
  "consentStatus": "Pending",
  "className": "10A"
}

### 2. Create HealthCheckForm - Missing required field
POST https://localhost:7111/api/HealthCheckForm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": 1,
  "consentStatus": "Pending",
  "className": "10A"
}

### 3. Create HealthCheckForm - Invalid status
POST https://localhost:7111/api/HealthCheckForm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "parentId": 1,
  "consentStatus": "InvalidStatus",
  "className": "10A"
}

### 4. Get all HealthCheckForms
GET https://localhost:7111/api/HealthCheckForm

### 5. Get HealthCheckForm by ID
GET https://localhost:7111/api/HealthCheckForm/1 